    - key: 201
      value:
        matchups: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 55d62e93f93a1f34badabec3d1a83f4a, type: 2}
        description: '12,000 hull; 10,000 shields; speed 18. Twenty-four targetable
          weapons: six dual heavy turbolaser main batteries, two heavy dual ion cannons,
          two medium dual ion cannons, eight dual medium turbolasers and six medium
          dual laser cannons, plus four point-defense guns. Two shield generators,
          two engines, tractor beam and hangar are targetable. Boost Weapon Power
          cuts weapon reload time by 90% and halves speed and shield regeneration
          for 7 s. Recovers in 50 s. Tractor Beam restricts enemy corvette or frigate
          movement. Deploys 2 fighters, 2 bombers, and 2 interceptors at once. Carries
          18 total squadron launches.'
        role: Capital ship / Advanced carrier
        iconKey: b8f66d736a9c0a841b8957320119ca55:21300000
